      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا أَدْرِى أَىُّ تُرْخَمٍ هُوَ</span></b>  (JK, S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُرْخَمَ</span>
(JK, K, TA, but not in the CK) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُرْخُمٍ</span> (S, K)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُرْخُمَ</span> (K, TA, but not in the CK) and, accord.
to the M, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرْخُم</span>, (TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُرْخَمَةَ</span></b> , (accord. to
the JK,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُرْخَمَةٍ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُرْخُمَةٍ</span>, (K,) <i>I know not
who of mankind he is.</i> (JK, S, K.)

